{"4838360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Construction Company", "steam_appid": 4838360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/4901d8d199995e162b47f8ade386948a.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR COMPANY FROM THE GROUND UP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit your grandfather's struggling construction company and turn it into a thriving business. Choose your company's identity, manage finances, hire employees, and take your first steps toward building a construction empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/ef077d5772b5eb723a56db93a38a48de.poster.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/ef077d5772b5eb723a56db93a38a48de.webm?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/ef077d5772b5eb723a56db93a38a48de.mp4?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIRE AND MANAGE YOUR WORKFORCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit workers, assign them to crews, and build efficient teams. Every employee has unique skills and experience, making workforce management a key part of your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/44d3f56c6e13e135ad8eb4da94e7de34.poster.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/44d3f56c6e13e135ad8eb4da94e7de34.webm?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/44d3f56c6e13e135ad8eb4da94e7de34.mp4?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAKE ON CONTRACTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete construction projects across suburbs, city districts, downtown areas, and special locations. Plan resources carefully, meet deadlines, and earn money, reputation, and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/8aeeffe586b4bf7876b4d0cc421d73d0.poster.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/8aeeffe586b4bf7876b4d0cc421d73d0.webm?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/8aeeffe586b4bf7876b4d0cc421d73d0.mp4?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR FINANCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track expenses and income, repay debts, take out loans, and make strategic decisions that determine the future of your company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/5d35117991eb2875a41aa8040c1c5505.poster.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/5d35117991eb2875a41aa8040c1c5505.webm?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/5d35117991eb2875a41aa8040c1c5505.mp4?t=1787919039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/d9b43d7ceda3734481f83b8ee8efa638.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new types of construction equipment, purchase vehicles, and prepare your company for increasingly demanding projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/aa24f211a607cc928f5fe3e0a63c188b.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor material prices, stock up on supplies, and ensure every project has the resources it needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/acfab05fdd1dc41c4838c5c1673dc85f.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase land, construct your own house using company resources and workers, then expand and upgrade it as your business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838360/extras/4b509fc0b212c8c75796417519b15031.avif?t=1787919039\" width=1110 height=400 